   "roundness": null,
   "text": "under the two-tier rule: the exact spec \u2014 scope, the why, its own\ncheck \u2014 plus access to related materials. AND NO MORE. a builder\nholding the whole file re-derives intent from it; a builder holding\none self-contained piece builds that piece.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "under the two-tier rule: the exact spec \u2014 scope, the why, its own\ncheck \u2014 plus access to related materials. AND NO MORE. a builder\nholding the whole file re-derives intent from it; a builder holding\none self-contained piece builds that piece.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
