   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "MACHINE: every declared layer conforms, per layer.\nHUMAN:   Tony uses the OUTPUT ITSELF \u2014 the app feature, the\n         performance, the document, the diagram, whatever it finally\n         is \u2014 checked as the EXPERT USER, not as a reader of reports.",
   "fontSize": 12,
